  "content": "\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LeQT1XY.png\" />\n    <br><br>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury%20API-required-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Server%20side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Client%20side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>在《Epic Fight》中提升等級！</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WED5uB3.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>功能特色</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>雙持武器</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">雙持武器模組會將經驗值正確套用至玩家實際使用的武器。(在較新版本的 Epic Fight 中可獨立運作)</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>物品升級</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">本模組完全支援所有 Epic Fight 的武器與護甲！</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>為什麼要安裝此模組？</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">雖然 Weapon Leveling 原本就能與 Epic Fight 配合運作，但搭配此模組可讓你提升副手武器的等級（Epic Fight 的新版本已內建此功能，不再需要此相容層）。這是舊版 WL 的功能，若你使用的是 3.0.0 以下版本的 WeaponLeveling，則無需安裝此模組。</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">將其拆分為獨立模組的決定，旨在讓未來的更新更加迅速與簡潔。\n    <br><br>\n    <font size=\"4\">使用此模組的另一大理由是全面支援 Epic Fight 的所有武器類型。只需修改對應武器類型的可升級 JSON 檔案，即可輕鬆自訂。現在也支援散落護甲（Stray Armor）了。\n</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">此為 Weapon Leveling 的官方擴充模組</font>\n    <br>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/weapon-leveling\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uxu46dk.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n    </a>\n    <br>\n \n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>擴充模組資訊</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\" >此擴充模組由 Weapon Leveling 的開發者 GekidoLukas 製作。有關此模組的任何問題請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/wl_bc_compat/issues\">此模組的 Issue 頁面</a> 提交。若要申請新增其他相容性擴充模組，請透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/weaponleveling/issues\">Weapon Leveling 的 Issue 頁面</a> 進行</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
